You're #C000246204in the Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,
where #C236196003BB#CDEF was born;
where the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF were born―――

I thought you were a spoiled, rich kid;
an elitism fanatic; a horrible prick at
heart, but…

That culprit who imprisoned us all here;
That AI who destroyed the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――
Is #C236196003BB#CDEF.

The same thought hangs over all of us;
we're each afraid of what our "forgotten" memories
will be like.

#C080080080Once I focus my awareness and pick from the
bottom of my thoughts, I see one, and then another;
THEIR visages, the ones I had overcome, return to me.#CDEF
